# CODEOWNERS — enables automatic review requests once branch protection
# requires review from a code owner (see docs/REFACTOR_STRATEGY.md's CI/CD
# section for the other manual repo-settings steps, like branch protection
# itself, that pair with this file). Meaningful even for a single-maintainer
# project: it's what makes "request review" happen automatically instead of
# depending on someone remembering to add a reviewer by hand.
#
# Order matters — later patterns override earlier ones for files they both
# match, same as .gitignore.

